        <article class="heritage-copy">
            <h3>The Timeless Art of Malaysian Songket</h3>

            <p>Known as the “Queen of Fabrics, Songket is a rich tapesty woven with gold or silver threads. This centuries old craft represents the pinnacle of Malaysian textile heritage, often worn during royal ceremonies and festive occasions.</p>

