    <div class="culinary-grid">
        <article class="culinary-copy">
            <h3>Nasi Lemak</h3>

            <p>Considered Malaysia's national dish, nasi lemak combines fragrant coconut rice, spicy sambal, crunchy anchovies, roasted peanuts, and fresh cucumber. It is a flavorful symbol of local identity, enjoyed from street stalls to modern restaurants.</p>

